			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760430101,
					"content": "「流浪之環」的案子，如果我沒記錯的話，當時並沒有定論。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430102,
					"content": "是的，商隊的貨品失竊，被懷疑是犯人的那人不僅不承認，還打死了人，最後逃跑了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430103,
					"content": "據說這兩人都是海盜出身，原本是同伴，十年來相安無事，最後卻落得如此下場，不免令人唏噓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430104,
					"content": "可是老闆，這在挪德卡萊也不是什麼稀罕的事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430105,
					"content": "呵…尋常不代表沒有價值。要知道，線索往往藏於幽微處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430106,
					"content": "哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430107,
					"content": "雅珂達，妳去找「信使」打聽一下。應該能收獲不少被忽視的細節。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760430108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 760430108,
					"content": "好的，老闆，就交給我吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7604302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7604302
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
